    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to find unique and exclusive content, paranormal streamer Symon stumbles upon an obscure urban legend known only as the &quot;Phantom Incident&quot;. Hardly any information of the event exists besides mentions in a small newspaper and stories from locals. Seeing this as a perfect scoop for his social media, he jumps at the opportunity to bring new light to the story and gain more followers in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Perigee Gas Station, Henderson Estate and surrounding area, solving puzzles and using your resources wisely to move forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Document your journey by filming segments and collecting evidence. The evidence you uncover will determine your understanding at the conclusion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADDITIONAL INFO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice acted (English only).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is roughly 45-60 minutes to complete and has multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to find unique and exclusive content, paranormal streamer Symon stumbles upon an obscure urban legend known only as the &quot;Phantom Incident&quot;. Hardly any information of the event exists besides mentions in a small newspaper and stories from locals. Seeing this as a perfect scoop for his social media, he jumps at the opportunity to bring new light to the story and gain more followers in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Perigee Gas Station, Henderson Estate and surrounding area, solving puzzles and using your resources wisely to move forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Document your journey by filming segments and collecting evidence. The evidence you uncover will determine your understanding at the conclusion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADDITIONAL INFO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice acted (English only).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is roughly 45-60 minutes to complete and has multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
